@access_token = ACCESS_TOKEN
@refresh_token = REFRESH_TOKEN

### Login — obtain access and refresh tokens
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/jwt/create/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "test-password"
}

### Refresh — obtain a new access token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/jwt/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

### Protected profile — authenticated request
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Protected profile — missing access token -> 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/profile/

### Logout — blacklist refresh token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/logout/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

### Refresh after logout — must not issue a new access token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/jwt/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{refresh_token}}"
}